{"4816410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes In Static", "steam_appid": 4816410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4816630, 4988070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nightmare is Online.</strong> <br>You are Levi, trapped inside a mission you were designated to by the ECHO Program, a secret government investigation team, with something that was never meant to wake up. <i>Echoes in Static</i> is a tense, psychological survival horror experience where every footstep matters and every shadow hides a threat. You were trained for days like these, but are you trained for what each environment has to offer you? we will see ECHO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being hunted by the EX Program, custom built, rogue animatronics driven by a terrifyingly cold, calculating logic. They do not feel pity. They do not tire. They know exactly where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you scavenge each facility to uncover the horrifying truth and find a way out with each area explored? Or will you build the tools necessary to take the fight to the enemy? The choice is yours, but every action has consequences.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nightmare is Online.</strong> <br>You are Levi, trapped inside a mission you were designated to by the ECHO Program, a secret government investigation team, with something that was never meant to wake up. <i>Echoes in Static</i> is a tense, psychological survival horror experience where every footstep matters and every shadow hides a threat. You were trained for days like these, but are you trained for what each environment has to offer you? we will see ECHO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being hunted by the EX Program, custom built, rogue animatronics driven by a terrifyingly cold, calculating logic. They do not feel pity. They do not tire. They know exactly where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap